SUMMARY:Applying to Grad School Workshop and Panel
DESCRIPTION:Are you considering a grad program in Philosophy at U of T? If so\, we invite you to join us for our annual “Applying to Grad School” workshop. The event will take place on Zoom\, with the appropriate link added closer to the date. \nAt the workshop you will hear information about requirements\, application procedures\, and deadlines. Our panel of experts will share advice and be available to answer audience questions. \nPanelists\n\nAndrew Franklin-Hall\, Director of Graduate Admissions\nMichael Miller\, Director of Undergraduate Studies\nAri Okubo\, PhD student\nEithar Abdulkareen\, MA student\n\nPlease RSVP at this link: 2026 Applying to Grad School Panel RSVP – Fill out form \nJoin Zoom Meeting – TBD
URL:https://philosophy.utoronto.ca/event/applying-to-grad-school-workshop-and-panel/
LOCATION:Ontario
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://philosophy.utoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/Applying-to-Grad-School-2021.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:UofT Philosophy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261105T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261105T170000
