SUMMARY:Early Modern Philosophy Research Interest Group (Raphaelle Dupont\, U of T)
DESCRIPTION:The Early Modern Philosophy Research Interest Group welcomes Raphaelle Dupont\, a PhD student in the department. Her main research interests are in the history of philosophy\, especially in the transition between late medieval and early modern metaphysics. Before joining the department\, she completed her Master’s studies with a thesis on Spinoza’s metaphysics. \nTalk Title\nTBD \nTalk Abstract\nTBD
