SUMMARY:Global Philosophy Research Group (Monica Z. X. Ding\, U of T)
DESCRIPTION:The Global Philosophy Research Interest Group welcomes guest speaker Monica Z. X. Ding\, a postdoctoral fellow in the philosophy department at the University of Toronto. Her research focuses on the application of Classical Chinese philosophy to AI ethics. She is also interested in the nature of understanding and its applications to AI and misinformation\, as well as the use of epistemic verbs in English\, Cantonese\, and Mandarin. \nTalk Title\nTBD \nTalk Abstract\nTBD
