SUMMARY:Colloquium (Olivia Bailey\, UC Berkeley)
DESCRIPTION:The Department is pleased to welcome Olivia Bailey\, an assistant professor in the Department of Philosophy\, at UC Berkeley for a colloquium on December 3\, 2026. She works on questions in moral psychology and the history of moral philosophy (particularly the British moralists). Her current research is concerned with the ethical and epistemic significance of empathy. \nTitle\nTBD \nAbstract\nTBD
